---

---

<section class="section-case">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="text-center header">
            <span class="badge">SIMULATION</span>
            <h2>무엇이 달라질까요?</h2>
            <p class="subtitle">체계적인 관리로 만들어지는 변화</p>
        </div>

        <div class="case-wrapper">
            <div class="case-card before">
                <div class="label-badge">BEFORE</div>
                <img
                    src="/images/dianping_before.svg"
                    alt="Before Simulation"
                    class="simulation-img"
                />
                <p class="desc">단순 메뉴판 번역 / 한국인 위주 마케팅</p>
            </div>

            <div class="arrow">
                <svg
                    width="40"
                    height="40"
                    viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                    fill="none"
                    stroke="currentColor"
                    stroke-width="2"
                >
                    <path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"></path>
                </svg>
            </div>

            <div class="case-card after">
                <div class="label-badge">AFTER</div>
                <img
                    src="/images/dianping_after.svg"
                    alt="After Simulation"
                    class="simulation-img"
                />
                <p class="desc">
                    중국어 맞춤 리뷰·콘텐츠 / ‘필수 방문 코스’ 노출 강화
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <p class="disclaimer text-center">
            ※ 본 이미지는 이해를 돕기 위한 가상 예시입니다.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .section-case {
        background: #f8f9fa;
    }

    .header {
        margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }

    .badge {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 6px 16px;
        background: #e9ecef;
        color: #495057;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        border-radius: 100px;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    }

    h2 {
        font-size: 2.5rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .subtitle {
        color: var(--color-text-sub);
        font-size: 1.1rem;
    }

    .case-wrapper {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 2rem;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .case-card {
        background: white;
        padding: 2rem;
        border-radius: 20px;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        text-align: center;
        position: relative;
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 450px;
    }

    .case-card.after {
        border: 2px solid var(--color-accent);
        box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(255, 192, 0, 0.15);
    }

    .label-badge {
        position: absolute;
        top: -12px;
        left: 50%;
        transform: translateX(-50%);
        background: #666;
        color: white;
        padding: 4px 12px;
        border-radius: 12px;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        font-weight: 700;
    }

    .case-card.after .label-badge {
        background: var(--color-accent);
        color: #000;
    }

    .simulation-img {
        width: 100%;
        height: auto;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        border-radius: 8px;
        border: 1px solid #eee;
    }

    .desc {
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
    }

    .arrow {
        color: #999;
        flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .disclaimer {
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        color: #999;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
        .case-wrapper {
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 3rem;
        }
        .arrow {
            transform: rotate(90deg);
        }
    }
</style>
